  "item_short_desc": "<p>Elevate your child's outerwear with the Rothco Kids MA-1 Flight Jacket! Crafted for versatility and durability, this water-resistant jacket boasts a 4-pocket design with a reversible inside, allowing for effortless style switches. The ribbed knit collar, cuffs, and waistband ensure a snug and comfortable fit, while the brass zippers and 100% nylon outer shell guarantee long-lasting performance. For added convenience, the jacket features a zippered utility pocket on the left arm, perfect for storing small essentials.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "5604",
  "description": "<p>Elevate your child's outerwear with the Rothco Kids MA-1 Flight Jacket! Crafted for versatility and durability, this water-resistant jacket boasts a 4-pocket design with a reversible inside, allowing for effortless style switches. The ribbed knit collar, cuffs, and waistband ensure a snug and comfortable fit, while the brass zippers and 100% nylon outer shell guarantee long-lasting performance. For added convenience, the jacket features a zippered utility pocket on the left arm, perfect for storing small essentials. Lined with poly fiber fill, it provides ample warmth on chilly days, making it ideal for any outdoor adventure. Whether your little one is exploring the neighborhood or embarking on a weekend getaway, the Rothco Kids MA-1 Flight Jacket offers both practicality and style.</p>",
